    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "BE32B3458977D795",
      "text": "¿Quieres enfrentarte al Líder de Gimnasio Fuco,\\nel Chef Torrencial?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "BE32B0458977D27C",
      "text": "Muy bien, permíteme acompañarte a la arena de\\ncombate.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "BE32B1458977D42F",
      "text": "Avísame cuando estés list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, no hay prisa.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_boy_entry_01",
      "hash64": "A66AD42AF62B610B",
      "text": "¡Fuco, Fuco! ¡Ven a jugar conmigo, porfa!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_woman_entry_01",
      "hash64": "3EB8108C114F97B3",
      "text": "Me haría un favor si probara el nuevo menú de\\nmi restaurante.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_entry_01",
      "hash64": "9DC5825CD21ED7A0",
      "text": "¡Lo siento mucho, chicos, pero el deber me llama\\nen el gimnasio![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_entry_02",
      "hash64": "9DC5855CD21EDCB9",
      "text": "Y un servicio nunca puede salir tarde, así que sed\\nrazonables y dejadme ir.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_girl_entry_01",
      "hash64": "43B5DA4BCCC05C43",
      "text": "¡Vaaale!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "5DF008B7D2FAC2E1",
      "text": "¡Oh, eres tú! ¡Avante, avante![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "5DF005B7D2FABDC8",
      "text": "¡Mil gracias por tu ayuda en Pueblo Marinada![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "5DF006B7D2FABF7B",
      "text": "Me da que ahora podré elaborar unos platos de\\nalgas como nadie ha probado jamás.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "5DF00BB7D2FAC7FA",
      "text": "¡Pero no creas que eso hará que te lo ponga\\nfácil en combate![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
